[
  {
    "id": "shore-limit-api",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "Shore limit API",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "GET  /shore-limit  -> {\"276\": <A>, \"288\": <A>}\nPOST /shore-limit  <- {\"instance\": 276|288, \"limit\": <A>}\n\nRoutes on the vebus instance, never a unit number: the dashboard's\nL1 card is instance 288 (/dev/ttyUSB0) and L2 is 276 (/dev/ttyS4).\nClamped to 50 A, the max both units report.\n\nInstance 288 reports CurrentLimitIsAdjustable = 0, so writes to it\nare refused until 'Overruled by remote' is set in VEConfigure."
  },
